Multiply by the reciprocal of the fraction.

$$
\begin{array}{l}
\phantom{00}7\times\frac{5}{4}\\
=\frac{7\times5}{4} \\
=\frac{35}{4}\\
=8\frac{3}{4}
\end{array}
$$

Multiply by the reciprocal of the fraction.

$$
\begin{array}{l}
\phantom{00}8\times\frac{4}{3}\\
=\frac{8\times4}{3} \\
=\frac{32}{3}\\
=10\frac{2}{3}
\end{array}
$$

